# §28a: `--allow-inference-guess` (the one-release migration hatch) builds and runs a
# program whose type cannot be inferred, guessing as before -- with a warning naming it.
# Permanent: a zig"..." expression has no Zebra type.
def main()
    var x = zig"@as(i64, 5)"
    print("infer_hatch: ${x + 1}")
